<metadata><name>Stenje - Konjsko along Lake Prespa</name><desc>Follows the shore of Lake Prespa on stony, hard but mostly pleasant ground. Since it keeps to the shoreline, the ups and downs are insignificant. The low vegetation on either side tends to overgrow the path, so in places you may have to push through, mostly through grass. https://galicica.finereli.com/routes/stenje-konjsko-prespa-shore/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="40.933749" lon="20.925514"><name>Start: Stenje</name><desc>Stenje to Konjsko (Prespa): 8.4 km, 2 h 15 min, easy</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="40.913664" lon="20.981852"><name>Start: Konjsko (Prespa)</name><desc>Konjsko (Prespa) to Stenje: 8.4 km, 2 h 15 min, easy</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<trk><name>H-13: the MTB-9 junction to near Konjsko</name><desc>H-13 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 6.3 km from the MTB-9 junction to near Konjsko, climbing about 124 m and descending 57 m in the direction drawn, between 844 m and 923 m.</desc><type>H</type><extensions><gpxx:TrackExtension><gpxx:DisplayColor>Red</gpxx:DisplayColor></gpxx:TrackExtension><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>C8202F</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>4</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="40.933749" lon="20.925514"><ele>849</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.933239" lon="20.928119"><ele>855</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.933603" lon="20.930771"><ele>858</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.934378" lon="20.932261"><ele>844</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.934222" lon="20.932909"><ele>850</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.934236" lon="20.933954"><ele>858</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.934452" lon="20.935501"><ele>853</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.934871" lon="20.936705"><ele>860</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.935058" lon="20.937568"><ele>853</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.935080" lon="20.937643"><ele>853</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.935345" lon="20.939263"><ele>847</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.936359" lon="20.942026"><ele>845</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.936315" lon="20.944245"><ele>845</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.936141" lon="20.944794"><ele>852</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.935431" lon="20.945649"><ele>856</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.933982" lon="20.946645"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932969" lon="20.948300"><ele>862</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932953" lon="20.948311"><ele>862</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932945" lon="20.948328"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932934" lon="20.948341"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932926" lon="20.948362"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932919" lon="20.948378"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932891" lon="20.948395"><ele>861</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.932919" lon="20.948628"><ele>855</ele></trkpt><trk